    {
      "id": "automation_dry_run_mutates",
      "severity_for_adoption": "block unattended use",
      "finding": "Improvement shell wrapper performs fetch, checkout -B, reset --hard, git clean -fd and replaces logs/reports before forwarding --dry-run. SKILL_LOOP_CHECKOUT is configurable without a canonical-path guard rejecting the primary repository. Python dry-run itself still writes logs/state and runs structural scoring.",
